### GET - Obtener solicitudes pendientes para un receptor
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/pendientes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET - Obtener solicitudes pendientes (usuario 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/pendientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### POST - Enviar solicitud a un usuario por username
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/enviar?username=lfernandez
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### POST - Enviar solicitud a otro usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/enviar?username=mmartinez
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Aceptar solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/1/aceptar?receptorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Aceptar otra solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/2/aceptar?receptorId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Rechazar solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/1/rechazar?receptorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Rechazar otra solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/3/rechazar?receptorId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### DELETE - Cancelar solicitud
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/1/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### DELETE - Cancelar otra solicitud
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/2/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}